			"hadithnumber": 3365,
			"arabicnumber": 3365,
			"text": "It was narrated from Jabir that a group of people came to the Prophet (ﷺ) and he noticed the smell of leeks coming from them. He said:“Did I not forbid you to eat these vegetables? For the angels are offended by that which offends people.”",
